  "   ✓ interpolates between two known points (2 ms)",
  "   ✓ falls back to the nearest point at the edges (1 ms)",
  "",
  /* The failure sits HIGH on purpose: all three of the verdict's tokens — FAIL,
     line 14, and the type error — have to be findable in the part of the wall
