          <p class="hero-sub">How it works, what it costs, less waste, consistent.</p>
          <p class="byline">Atil Ilerialkan · live from atilileri.github.io</p>
          <aside class="notes">
            Ninety seconds, standing still. You are already paying for AI, and
            the bill is going up — so this is not a talk about whether to use
