          <p class="chapter-sub">The models are good now. <br />Isn&rsquo;t that enough?</p>
          <aside class="notes">
            Say both lines in their voice, not yours — this is the objection
            the room is already holding, and naming it out loud first is what
            buys you the next forty minutes.

            The second line is the real one. Concede it hard and mean it: the
            models ARE good now, better than last year, and for a lot of work
