            HOW TO DRIVE IT: press c once — read the note, the correction and the
            wrong turn are now both in the window. Press c again — the wrong turn
            has bred, and the rule appears: two failed corrections is Anthropic's
            published line, not our opinion. Then x — and SAY IT WHILE THE TURNS
