              that climbs from 17% to 97% in the published measurement.

              "Does this touch our toolchain?" A PlantUML diagram is opaque text
              to Polarion, so a generated diagram naming REQ-1234 creates no
              link and no trace, and nothing notices if REQ-1234 does not exist.
              The verifier parses the diagram and resolves every identifier
              against the Polarion API. That check is a script, not a model —
              chapter 4's guardrail pattern exactly.
            </aside>
          </section>
        </section>

